From 2a34bd91d4342655ced6dc0c2820bf5f69b5d263 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 21 Jun 2026 13:08:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: wallet card on profile + driver rating reply + rating
 stat

- Remove broken stat-spent reference (element renamed to stat-wallet)
- fetchWallet() fetches balance from Supabase wallets table
- Driver rating reply persists via PATCH to ratings.driver_reply
- loadRatingStat() fires at startup so stat card shows number immediately
- Wallet uses add_wallet_balance RPC to accumulate not overwrite

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
